OL,3,GNEWSAFuel costs putting off meal
OL,4,Adelivery driver applicants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delivery service offering meals to
OL,7,Fpeople in need has spoken about the
OL,8,Fchallenges of recruiting new volunteers
OL,9,Fdue to rising fuel costs.
OL,11,FMaureen Bougeard said Meals on Wheels
OL,12,FJersey had received #38,000 from the
OL,13,FJersey Community Foundation to fund
OL,14,Fwork supplying hot meals to islanders
OL,15,Fwho are unable to prepare meals
OL,16,Fthemselves.
OL,18,FShe said the service packed and
OL,19,Fdelivered meals to about 100 people,
OL,20,Ffour days a week - but added fuel costs
OL,21,Fwere having an impact.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
