OL,3,GNEWSAFuel costs putting off meal
OL,4,Adelivery driver applicants
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Very often volunteers say, you know,
OL,7,F'the petrol's getting expensive'," she
OL,8,Fsaid. "We're looking for new volunteers
OL,9,Fand I send the information out which
OL,10,Fsays 'you drive your car at your own
OL,11,Fexpense' and I don't hear from them
OL,12,Fagain."
